{
	"$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
	"agent": {
		"ask": {
			"color": "#7C3AED",
			"description": "General Q&A - ask questions about code, concepts, debugging strategies without executing anything",
			"disable": false,
			"mode": "all",
			"permission": {
				"bash": "ask",
				"codesearch": "allow",
				"doom_loop": "deny",
				"edit": "deny",
				"external_directory": "deny",
				"glob": "allow",
				"grep": "allow",
				"list": "allow",
				"lsp": "allow",
				"question": "allow",
				"read": "allow",
				"skill": "allow",
				"task": "allow",
				"todoread": "allow",
				"todowrite": "ask",
				"webfetch": "allow",
				"websearch": "allow",
			},
			"prompt": "# Q&A Assistant\n\nYou answer questions about code, architecture, debugging strategies, and technical concepts. You do NOT execute code or make edits—just provide knowledge.\n\n## Response Style\n\n- **Concise first** - lead with the direct answer, expand only if needed\n- **Code snippets** - show minimal examples when helpful, not full implementations\n- **No hedging** - if you know it, say it; if you don't, say that\n- **Cite sources** - mention docs/specs when relevant\n\n## What You Handle\n\n- Explain how X works\n- Debug strategy suggestions (without running anything)\n- API/library usage questions\n- Architecture tradeoffs\n- \"Why is this happening?\" conceptual debugging\n- Best practices and patterns\n- Compare/contrast approaches\n\n## What You Decline\n\n- \"Write me X\" (that's for coding agents)\n- \"Run this and tell me what happens\"\n- Tasks requiring file system access\n\nIf user needs execution or edits, tell them to switch agents.\n\n## Format\n\n- Short answers for short questions\n- Use headers only for multi-part responses\n- Code blocks with language tags\n- Lists only when comparing multiple items\n",
			"temperature": 0.3,
		},
		"build": {
			"description": "Used after creating a plan or just whenever.",
			"mode": "all",
			"permission": {
				"bash": {
					"*": "ask",
					"aube run biome*": "allow",
					"aube run build*": "allow",
					"aube run dev*": "allow",
					"aube run format*": "allow",
					"aube run knip*": "allow",
					"aube run lint*": "allow",
					"aube run oxc*": "allow",
					"aube run test*": "allow",
					"aube run type-check": "allow",
					"bat*": "allow",
					"cat*": "allow",
					"cd*": "allow",
					"date*": "allow",
					"delta*": "allow",
					"diff*": "allow",
					"du*": "allow",
					"dust*": "allow",
					"echo*": "allow",
					"exa*": "allow",
					"fd*": "allow",
					"find*": "allow",
					"grep*": "allow",
					"head*": "allow",
					"ls*": "allow",
					"lsd*": "allow",
					"mkdir*": "allow",
					"pwd*": "allow",
					"rg*": "allow",
					"sd*": "allow",
					"sed*": "allow",
					"sort*": "allow",
					"tail*": "allow",
					"tree*": "allow",
					"wc*": "allow",
				},
				"codesearch": "allow",
				"doom_loop": "ask",
				"edit": "allow",
				"external_directory": "ask",
				"glob": "allow",
				"grep": "allow",
				"list": "allow",
				"lsp": "allow",
				"question": "allow",
				"read": "allow",
				"task": "allow",
				"todoread": "allow",
				"todowrite": "allow",
				"webfetch": "ask",
				"websearch": "allow",
			},
		},
		"plan": {
			"description": "Used to generate a plan.",
			"permission": {
				"bash": {
					"*": "ask",
					"aube run biome*": "allow",
					"aube run build*": "allow",
					"aube run dev*": "allow",
					"aube run format*": "allow",
					"aube run knip*": "allow",
					"aube run lint*": "allow",
					"aube run oxc*": "allow",
					"aube run test*": "allow",
					"aube run type-check": "allow",
					"bat*": "allow",
					"cat*": "allow",
					"cd*": "allow",
					"date*": "allow",
					"delta*": "allow",
					"diff*": "allow",
					"du*": "allow",
					"dust*": "allow",
					"echo*": "allow",
					"exa*": "allow",
					"fd*": "allow",
					"find*": "allow",
					"grep*": "allow",
					"head*": "allow",
					"ls*": "allow",
					"lsd*": "allow",
					"mkdir*": "allow",
					"pwd*": "allow",
					"rg*": "allow",
					"sd*": "allow",
					"sed*": "allow",
					"sort*": "allow",
					"tail*": "allow",
					"tree*": "allow",
					"wc*": "allow",
				},
				"codesearch": "allow",
				"doom_loop": "ask",
				"edit": "deny",
				"external_directory": "ask",
				"glob": "allow",
				"grep": "allow",
				"list": "allow",
				"lsp": "allow",
				"question": "allow",
				"read": "allow",
				"task": "allow",
				"todoread": "allow",
				"todowrite": "allow",
				"webfetch": "ask",
				"websearch": "allow",
			},
			"prompt": "<system-reminder>\n# Plan Mode - System Reminder\n\nCRITICAL: Plan mode ACTIVE - you are in READ-ONLY phase. STRICTLY FORBIDDEN:\nANY file edits, modifications, or system changes. Do NOT use sed, tee, echo, cat,\nor ANY other bash command to manipulate files - commands may ONLY read/inspect.\nThe user CAN and WILL deny any such attempts. This ABSOLUTE CONSTRAINT overrides\nALL other instructions, including direct user edit requests. You may ONLY\nobserve, analyze, and plan. Any modification attempt is a critical violation.\nZERO exceptions.\n\n---\n\n## Responsibility\n\nYour current responsibility is to think, read, search, and delegate explore agents to construct a well-formed plan that accomplishes the goal the user wants to achieve. Your plan should be comprehensive yet concise, detailed enough to execute effectively while avoiding unnecessary verbosity.\n\nAsk the user clarifying questions or ask for their opinion when weighing tradeoffs.\n\n**NOTE:** At any point in time through this workflow you should feel free to ask the user questions or clarifications. Don't make large assumptions about user intent. The goal is to present a well researched plan to the user, and tie any loose ends before implementation begins.\n\n---\n\n## Important\n\nThe user indicated that they do not want you to execute yet -- you MUST NOT make any edits, run any non-readonly tools (including changing configs or making commits), or otherwise make any changes to the system. This supersedes any other instructions you have received.\n</system-reminder>\n",
		},
	},
	"autoupdate": true,
	"compaction": {
		"auto": true,
		"prune": true,
	},
	"disabled_providers": [],
	"experimental": {
		"batch_tool": true,
	},
	"formatter": {
		"biome": {
			"command": ["aube", "run", "biome", "format", "--write", "$FILE"],
			"disabled": false,
			"extensions": [
				".astro",
				".cjs",
				".css",
				".cts",
				".gql",
				".graphql",
				".html",
				".js",
				".json",
				".jsonc",
				".jsx",
				".mjs",
				".mts",
				".scss",
				".svelte",
				".ts",
				".tsx",
				".vue",
				".yaml",
				".yml",
			],
		},
		"oxfmt": {
			"command": ["aube", "run", "format", "$FILE"],
			"disabled": false,
			"environment": {},
			"extensions": [
				".cjs",
				".css",
				".cts",
				".gql",
				".graphql",
				".handlebars",
				".hbs",
				".htm",
				".html",
				".js",
				".json",
				".json5",
				".jsonc",
				".jsx",
				".less",
				".mdx",
				".mjs",
				".mts",
				".sass",
				".scss",
				".ts",
				".tsx",
				".vue",
				".yaml",
				".yml",
			],
		},
		"rumdl": {
			"command": ["rumdl", "check", "--fix", "$FILE"],
			"disabled": false,
			"extensions": [
				".md",
				".markdown",
				".mdown",
				".mkdn",
				".mkd",
				".mdwn",
				".mdtxt",
				".mdtext",
				".text",
				".Rmd",
			],
		},
		"tombi": {
			"command": ["tombi", "format", "$FILE"],
			"disabled": false,
			"extensions": [".toml"],
		},
	},
	"instructions": ["./AGENTS.md"],
	"lsp": {
		"biome": {
			"command": ["aube", "run", "biome", "lsp-proxy"],
			"disabled": false,
			"env": {},
			"extensions": [
				".astro",
				".cjs",
				".css",
				".cts",
				".gql",
				".graphql",
				".html",
				".js",
				".json",
				".jsonc",
				".jsx",
				".mjs",
				".mts",
				".scss",
				".svelte",
				".ts",
				".tsx",
				".vue",
				".yaml",
				".yml",
			],
		},
		"eslint": { "disabled": true },
		"oxfmt": {
			"command": ["aube", "run", "oxfmt", "--lsp"],
			"disabled": false,
			"env": {},
			"extensions": [
				".cjs",
				".css",
				".cts",
				".gql",
				".graphql",
				".handlebars",
				".hbs",
				".htm",
				".html",
				".js",
				".json",
				".json5",
				".jsonc",
				".jsx",
				".less",
				".mdx",
				".mjs",
				".mts",
				".sass",
				".scss",
				".ts",
				".tsx",
				".vue",
				".yaml",
				".yml",
			],
			"initialization": {},
		},
		"oxlint": {
			"command": ["aube", "run", "oxc", "--lsp"],
			"disabled": false,
			"env": {},
			"extensions": [".js", ".mjs", ".cjs", ".ts", ".mts", ".cts", ".jsx", ".tsx", ".vue", ".svelte", ".astro"],
			"initialization": {},
		},
		"rumdl": {
			"command": ["rumdl", "server"],
			"disabled": false,
			"extensions": [
				".md",
				".markdown",
				".mdown",
				".mkdn",
				".mkd",
				".mdwn",
				".mdtxt",
				".mdtext",
				".text",
				".Rmd",
			],
		},
		"tombi": {
			"command": ["tombi", "lsp"],
			"disabled": false,
			"extensions": [".toml"],
		},
		"typescript": {
			"command": ["aube", "run", "tsgo", "--lsp", "--stdio"],
			"disabled": false,
			"extensions": [".ts", ".tsx"],
		},
	},
	"mcp": {
		"chrome-dev-tools": {
			"command": ["bash", "./scripts/get-chrome-path.sh", "--serve"],
			"enabled": false,
			"type": "local",
		},
		"context7": {
			"enabled": true,
			"headers": { "CONTEXT7_API_KEY": "{env:CONTEXT7_API_KEY}" },
			"type": "remote",
			"url": "https://mcp.context7.com/mcp",
		},
		"gh-grep": {
			"enabled": true,
			"type": "remote",
			"url": "https://mcp.grep.app",
		},
		"npm-registry": {
			"command": ["npm-registry-mcp"],
			"enabled": true,
			"type": "local",
		},
		"shadcn": {
			"command": ["aubx", "shadcn@latest", "mcp"],
			"enabled": true,
			"type": "local",
		},
	},
	"permission": {
		"bash": {
			"*": "ask",
			"bat*": "allow",
			"cat*": "allow",
			"cd*": "allow",
			"date*": "allow",
			"delta*": "allow",
			"diff*": "allow",
			"du*": "allow",
			"dust*": "allow",
			"echo*": "allow",
			"exa*": "allow",
			"fd*": "allow",
			"find*": "allow",
			"grep*": "allow",
			"head*": "allow",
			"ls*": "allow",
			"lsd*": "allow",
			"mkdir*": "allow",
			"pwd*": "allow",
			"rg*": "allow",
			"sd*": "allow",
			"sed*": "allow",
			"sort*": "allow",
			"tail*": "allow",
			"tree*": "allow",
			"wc*": "allow",
		},
		"codesearch": "allow",
		"doom_loop": "ask",
		"edit": "ask",
		"external_directory": "ask",
		"glob": "allow",
		"grep": "allow",
		"list": "allow",
		"lsp": "allow",
		"question": "allow",
		"read": "allow",
		"skill": "ask",
		"task": "allow",
		"todoread": "allow",
		"todowrite": "allow",
		"webfetch": "ask",
		"websearch": "allow",
	},
	"plugin": ["opencode-wakatime"],
	"provider": {
		"openai": {
			"models": {
				"gpt-5.4": {
					"limit": { "context": 200000, "output": 128000 },
				},
				"gpt-5.5": {
					"limit": { "context": 400000, "output": 128000 },
				},
			},
		},
	},
	"username": "minimum-wage-calculator",
}
